flutter_uat
===========

Portions of this package are derived from work shared personally by David Adegoke (Cake Wallet):

  - lib/src/assets/scripts/emu.sh      (emulator helper: list, start, stop)
  - lib/src/assets/skill/SKILL.md      (the agent guide)

They were then extended and rewritten for this package. The remaining scripts, the Dart command-line
front end, the tests and the documentation are additions made here.

The MIT License in the LICENSE file covers the additions made in this package. The original work was
shared as a personal share and its terms of reuse are the author's to state: see the project repository for
the status of his permission before reusing or redistributing the derived files.
